    faq: ["Does a click prove somebody bought?", "No. It indicates tracked link activity. A completed sale, appointment, or signup needs evidence from the destination system. Linkar’s campaign activity helps you inspect the conversation stage without inventing outcomes it cannot observe."],
    related: ["/features/instagram-automation-analytics", "/features/instagram-reply-ab-testing", "/templates/booking-link"],
