    intro: "Facebook Page comments often repeat practical questions about products, hours, and availability. Linkar can post the public response you prepared when a supported Page comment matches your automation. That answer stays under the comment, where other visitors can read it too. Choose broad acknowledgements carefully and reserve detailed answers for keywords or posts with the right context.",
    benefits: [["Keep useful answers visible", "A public product detail or hours link can help the original commenter and other visitors. Write it knowing everyone reading the post may see it."], ["Respond deliberately", "Use selected words when the reply only fits a certain question. An acknowledgement for any comment should not make assumptions about what the person needs."], ["Protect private information", "Ask customers to use your private support process for order details. A public reply should never request an email address, phone number, or personal order information in the thread."]],
