    tip: ["Treat the whole thread as the audience", "Unlike an Instagram private reply, a Facebook Page comment response is visible to others. Keep the answer concise and factual, avoid personal details, and verify that a linked offer fits the post. Use a clear support route for account-specific issues rather than promising that an automatic comment has resolved them."],
    faq: ["Will this send a Facebook Messenger DM?", "No. These Linkar Facebook Page automations post public replies under comments. They should not be presented as Messenger chatbots or private message delivery. Instagram private replies use a different supported journey."],
