    benefits: [["Give each topic its own answer", "Prepare separate replies for price, hours, and support where those intentions are distinct. The public thread stays clearer than it would with one catch-all catalogue response."], ["Use language visitors recognise", "Pick words from real Page comments. Campaign codes can work for giveaways, while everyday phrasing works better for practical product questions."], ["Reduce accidental responses", "Test words that can appear in unrelated sentences. A broad keyword may match criticism or conversation where a canned answer would be inappropriate."]],
